    "body": "Well, i was using \"curl -fsSL https://starship.rs/install.sh | sh\" and looking at the release page again, a few minutes ago all the additional packages got added. At the moment of posting this issue there was only the source code attached.\r\n\r\nLooking at the time stamps i just tried to install about 5min too early. \r\nTrying again now worked like a charm.\r\n\r\nObviously the the release was posted (causing Github to send me a mail and the hasty myself to instantly trying to update) before all the packages where built. Maybe the order could be reversed and the release be issued after all steps are done.",
